# AI-POWERED EXPORT OUTREACH AUTOMATION SYSTEM — ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION

# 1. LIVE BUYER DISCOVERY SEARCH API (PRIMARY WORKFLOW)
# Real-time B2B discovery queries live search engines; CSV upload is purely optional.
# Supported providers: serper (Recommended - 2,500 free queries), brave (2,000 free queries), tavily, serpapi, google_cse
